# Copy to .env and fill in when ready to connect real services.
# The app runs entirely on mock data (see src/lib/providers) until these
# are set — and only Supabase's URL + anon key belong here at all. Any
# third-party API key (Anthropic, AeroAPI, OpenSky, ...) is a Supabase Edge
# Function secret instead (`supabase secrets set` — see supabase/README.md
# and supabase/.env.example), never a client env var: this file gets
# compiled straight into the app bundle, where anyone could extract a key
# from it.

SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
